  "content": "请提供需要翻译的文本。<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灾厄村民入侵将 Minecraft 中的灾厄村民提升到了全新高度！近十多种拥有独特能力的新灾厄村民将在你的世界中游荡。有些隐藏在危险的新结构中，而另一些则会加入村庄袭击，让挑战更加艰难。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">对抗更聪明的敌人，寻找强大的战利品，探索秘密地点。新的挑战意味着新的奖励——以及一路上的无尽乐趣！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 新灾厄村民</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">炼金术师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：擅长射箭，受到挑衅时会投掷滞留药水。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">档案员</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：为附近的灾厄村民施加强化附魔。受到惊吓时会逃跑并施法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">重击者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：手持盾牌的蛮横家伙，会向玩家冲锋。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掠夺者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：远程灾厄村民，投掷致命飞斧——从他身上偷取</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">铂金注能飞斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">煽动者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使用弓的灾厄村民，拥有基础增益法术。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">术士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：难以捉摸的施法者，能召唤危险的紫色火焰。掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">奇异之尘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">死灵法师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：亡灵大师，通过召唤法术压倒玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">审判官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：强大的灾厄村民战士，手持强力盾牌——先击破他的盾牌才能击败他！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">唤火者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：神秘的法师，看似无害——直到他释放毁灭性的魔法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">唤魔者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：最强大的灾厄村民！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">圣洁宝石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，可用于在</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">上升级附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻术师</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：现在以全新外观出现在生存模式！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻影之尘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 新结构</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">唤火者小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：带有农田的小房子。生成于恶地。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灾厄村民堡垒</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：设有围墙、塔楼和强大灾厄村民的防御哨所。生成于针叶林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🗼 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">幻术师塔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：多层塔楼，内有许多灾厄村民，顶层有幻术师战斗。生成于针叶林和黑森林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷宫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：巨大的地下迷宫，充满大量战利品和更多灾厄村民。寻找石制寺庙入口！生成于大多数森林生物群系。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">术士小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：小型房屋结构。生成于黑森林。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 新装备和物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：将附魔升级到正常极限之上！每次使用需要一块</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">圣洁宝石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">铂金注能飞斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：可投掷的斧类武器，由掠夺者稀有掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕯️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">失落之烛</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：通过揭示附近矿石的位置来帮助定位。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">视线号角</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：让附近的怪物发光，从而更快地找到它们！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端和服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可以直接在游戏内使用模组菜单进行配置（需要在 Fabric 上安装</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">模组菜单</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">制作）。请注意，在旧版 Minecraft 中，还需要安装</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge 配置屏幕</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有文件都位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">目录下，根据配置类型命名为</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。并非所有模组都存在所有类型的配置文件（视情况而定）。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特别感谢</span><a href=\"https://github.com/OhDricky\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Dricky</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他最初创作了精彩的灾厄村民扩展模组。Illager Invasion 是其作品的忠实延续，并包含了许多新增内容、改进、重做和错误修复。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/ZekeSmith\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ZekeSmith</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他在 Dricky 删除原始灾厄村民扩展源代码后找到了它，使得此移植版本能够在</span><a href=\"https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MIT</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">许可下实现。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/safrodev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">safrodev</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">致力于灾厄村民扩展的 1.19.2 版本，视线号角的纹理即来源于此。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">创作了许多令人惊叹的新纹理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectdescriptions/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
